function wRefLv(t,s){const D=WUQ[t][s];if(D.L)return D.L;const m=RARITY[D.rec[0]].m,st=MAGW(t),N=st?D.matk:D.atk;return D.L=Math.max(5,Math.round(((N/(m*(st?1.6:WEAPONS[t].f)*1.1))-8)/2.6));}
