/* ---------- Automated Diff vs the old generator ---------- */
function pdSig(p){return pdHash(p.t+'@'+p.x+','+p.y+'*'+p.s+'/'+p.v+'/'+p.f).toString(16);}   // fingerprint of what an object IS (kind, place, size, look)
/* stable id: pid = generatorId + slot (scatter: candidate index of its own number stream; ring: side + step ordinal + row; wall: side + distance). An Editor override stores (pid, sig):
   it applies only when the object with that pid still has the same sig, otherwise it is reported 'moved' / 'missing' and is NEVER applied to a different object. */
