/* =====================================================================
   v135 — SYLVA LAB · a small, separate, opt-in sandbox scene for the new painted art (house / tree / rocks / lamp / ground)
   • Default OFF (flag realm_sylvalab_v1). OFF = nothing is registered, no wrapper is installed → the game is the rc4 build.
   • ON (admin, GM panel): zone `sylva_lab` + 4 props + painted ground exist; buttons "เข้าฉากทดลอง" / "กลับโซนเดิม".
   • Never touches Sylva, Phase 4/5/6/7 data, the real layouts (PROP_KEY) or the save: while the scene is open every save
     is written with the zone / position you left from; kills in the scene give no exp / gold / drops.
   • The scene layout has its OWN slot (realm_sylvalab_layout_v1); the old Editor edits it (Save / Revert / Reset are redirected there).
   • Ground is painted at full resolution only for this zone (BGS is set to 1 while inside and restored on exit). Phase 5 is not used.
   ===================================================================== */
