/* v181: windmill rotor — the flat face-on rotor image is ROTATED first and then projected into the plane of the axle flange with WINDMILL.rotor.m (matrix measured from the flange ellipse of the building art); its hub sits on the measured axle end. Drawn right after the building sprite (same y-sort slot, so it is always in front of the tower and behind anything south of the building). */
