/* ---------------- Reflect affix: telegraphed state + budgeted, defended reflection (replaces the legacy "10% of everything you deal, straight to HP") ----------------
   State machine per reflecting monster: idle -> WARN (visible pulse + label) -> ON (visible mirror shell + label) -> idle. Only hits taken while ON reflect.
   Reflected value = rate x ACTUAL HP the monster lost (no overkill, no shield absorption, no DoT/echo). It is delivered through hurtPlayer (DEF, shields,
   Safe Zone, invulnerability all apply) as a source flagged reflectHit: no player-reflect recursion, no monster on-hit procs, no lifesteal.
   Budgets (configurable via S.RF): per cast <= perCastPct of the REFERENCE MaxHP across all targets; <= winPct in any rolling winSec per attacker.
   The reference MaxHP is captured when the cast / window starts, so swapping equipment cannot reset or enlarge a budget. Hit count never multiplies a cap. */
